WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:12.585
We have two bathrooms, but sometimes they are both full.

2
00:00:12.586 --> 00:00:14.083
Mom: What's wrong?

3
00:00:14.084 --> 00:00:16.658
Why are you squirming, Bada?

4
00:00:16.659 --> 00:00:23.345
Bada: I, I have to go to the bathroom.

5
00:00:23.346 --> 00:00:25.559
Mom: Well, go quickly then.

6
00:00:25.560 --> 00:00:30.793
Bada: I can't. Dad is still in there.

7
00:00:30.794 --> 00:00:32.979
Mom: What about the other one?

8
00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.658
Bada: Hana is taking a shower.

9
00:00:35.659 --> 00:00:40.101
Mom: Come on. Hold it just a little longer.

10
00:00:40.102 --> 00:00:41.989
Honey, can you hurry?

11
00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:44.466
Mom: Bada has to use the bathroom.

12
00:00:44.467 --> 00:00:47.590
Dad: Okay. I am almost done.

13
00:00:47.591 --> 00:00:51.526
Oh, we're out of toilet paper.

14
00:00:51.527 --> 00:00:53.809
Mom: I'll get another roll.

15
00:00:53.810 --> 00:00:59.004
Bada: Oooh, I can't hold it anymore.

16
00:00:59.005 --> 00:01:01.161
Bada learned a lesson.

17
00:01:01.162 --> 00:01:03.711
Don't wait until the last minute.

18
00:01:03.712 --> 00:01:08.982
When you want to go pee, don't wait. Go quickly!
